OL,3,GNEWSAHow did a rare falcon end up so
OL,4,Afar away from home?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwitchers armed with cameras were in
OL,7,Ftheir element this week after a rare
OL,8,Fbird of prey landed in Lowestoft - not
OL,9,Ffar from the aptly titled Gull Wing
OL,10,FBridge.
OL,12,FThe red-footed falcon's arrival has
OL,13,Fsparked excitement, drawing responses
OL,14,Fsuch as "oh wow" and heart-eye emojis
OL,15,Fgalore on social media, but is its
OL,16,Fcameo in Suffolk a cause for concern?
OL,18,FThe vulnerable species, which feeds on
OL,19,Finsects, amphibians, reptiles, mammals
OL,20,Fand birds, is native to Eastern Europe
OL,21,Fand Central Asia and spends its winters
OL,22,Fin Africa.
